# What `eb deploy` leaves out of the application bundle.
#
# With this file present the EB CLI ignores .gitignore and zips the working
# directory instead of the last git commit. That is deliberate: it is how the
# gitignored private course bank, data/problems.json, reaches the server.
#
# The local database is excluded because it is not the production one (that
# lives at /var/rung-data on the instance) and because it holds student data
# that has no reason to sit in an S3 application-version bucket.
.elasticbeanstalk/
.vercel/
.git/
.github/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
results/
tmp/
*.zip
data/*.db
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
